SCREEN CONTROL]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(CELL_MAIN_SCREEN_PB) ,NEQ(CELL_MESSAGE,0) ONS(ONS_ARRAY[13]) ][MOV(1,CELL_SCREEN) ,OTU(CELL_MAIN_SCREEN_PB) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
